{"type": "thinking", "text": "Now q83: K-8 likely GSoffered = 'K-8'. But could be GSserved = 'K-8'. Let's inspect relation between magnet and frpm. Need join. Let's run candidate queries counts.\n\nAlso q28: \"对本地拨款的学校，先计算 K-12 在校生数与 5-17 岁在校生数之差的平均值，再列出该差值高于此平均值的学校的名称与 DOC 类型\". Avg computed over locally funded schools. Need join schools and frpm. Could \"difference above average\" mean absolute? no.\n\nLet's write candidate SQLs and inspect. Also need determine whether frpm only has 2014-2015 one row per school (primary key CDSCode) yes.\n\nLet's use python to run all candidate interpretations and counts."}
{"type": "tool_call", "callId": "call_00_hex1H4hYWjSvyaCDxXnp7244", "tool": "bash", "input": {"command": "python3 - <<'PY'\nimport sqlite3\ncon=sqlite3.connect('inputs/db/california_schools.sqlite'); c=con.cursor()\ndef run(label,q):\n    try:\n        rows=c.execute(q).fetchall()\n        print('\\n###',label,'rows',len(rows))\n        for r in rows[:15]: print(r)\n    except Exception as e: print(label,'ERR',e)\n\nrun('q28','''SELECT s.School,s.DOC FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE s.FundingType='Locally funded' AND (f.`Enrollment (K-12)`-f.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)`) > (SELECT AVG(f2.`Enrollment (K-12)`-f2.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)`) FROM schools s2 JOIN frpm f2 ON s2.CDSCode=f2.CDSCode WHERE s2.FundingType='Locally funded')''')\n\nrun('q36','''SELECT s.AdmFName1,s.AdmLName1,s.AdmFName2,s.AdmLName2,s.AdmFName3,s.AdmLName3 FROM schools s JOIN satscores t ON s.CDSCode=t.cds ORDER BY t.NumGE1500 DESC LIMIT 1''')\nrun('q36 topval','''SELECT t.NumGE1500,t.sname FROM satscores t ORDER BY t.NumGE1500 DESC LIMIT 5''')\n\nrun('q62 lt0.18','''SELECT COUNT(*) FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE s.County='Los Angeles' AND s.Charter=0 AND f.`Free Meal Count (K-12)`*100/f.`Enrollment (K-12)` < 0.18''')\nrun('q62 lt.0018','''SELECT COUNT(*) FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE s.County='Los Angeles' AND s.Charter=0 AND f.`Free Meal Count (K-12)`/f.`Enrollment (K-12)` < 0.0018''')\nrun('q62 lt18','''SELECT COUNT(*) FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE s.County='Los Angeles' AND s.Charter=0 AND f.`Free Meal Count (K-12)`*100/f.`Enrollment (K-12)` < 18''')\n\nrun('q83 gsoffered','''SELECT s.City,COUNT(*) FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE s.Magnet=1 AND s.GSoffered='K-8' AND f.`NSLP Provision Status`='Multiple Provision Types' GROUP BY s.City''')\nrun('q83 gsserved','''SELECT s.City,COUNT(*) FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE s.Magnet=1 AND s.GSserved='K-8' AND f.`NSLP Provision Status`='Multiple Provision Types' GROUP BY s.City''')\nrun('q83 lowhigh','''SELECT s.City,COUNT(*) FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE s.Magnet=1 AND f.`Low Grade`='K' AND f.`High Grade`='8' AND f.`NSLP Provision Status`='Multiple Provision Types' GROUP BY s.City''')\n\nrun('q87','''SELECT s.AdmEmail1,s.AdmEmail2 FROM schools s WHERE s.County='San Bernardino' AND s.City='San Bernardino' AND s.DOC='54' AND s.OpenDate BETWEEN '2009-01-01' AND '2010-12-31' AND s.SOC='62' ''')\n\nrun('q12','''SELECT MAX(f.`Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)`/f.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)`) FROM frpm f JOIN satscores t ON f.CDSCode=t.cds WHERE t.NumGE1500*1.0/t.NumTstTakr > 0.3''')\nrun('q12 percent','''SELECT MAX(f.`Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)`*100/f.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)`) FROM frpm f JOIN satscores t ON f.CDSCode=t.cds WHERE t.NumGE1500*1.0/t.NumTstTakr > 0.3''')\n\nrun('q23','''SELECT s.School,s.Street FROM schools s JOIN frpm f ON s.CDSCode=f.CDSCode WHERE f.`Enrollment (K-12)`-f.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` > 30''')\n\nrun('q24','''SELECT f.`School Name` FROM frpm f JOIN satscores t ON f.CDSCode=t.cds WHERE f.`Free Meal Count (K-12)`/f.`Enrollment (K-12)` > 0.1 AND t.NumGE1500>0''')\n\nrun('q25 avg>400','''SELECT t.sname,f.`Charter Funding Type` FROM satscores t JOIN frpm f ON f.CDSCode=t.cds WHERE f.`District Name` LIKE 'Riverside%' AND t.AvgScrMath>400''')\nrun('q25 overallavg','''SELECT t.sname,f.`Charter Funding Type` FROM satscores t JOIN frpm f ON f.CDSCode=t.cds WHERE f.`District Name` LIKE 'Riverside%' AND (SELECT SUM(t2.AvgScrMath)*1.0/COUNT(*) FROM satscores t2 JOIN frpm f2 ON f2.CDSCode=t2.cds WHERE f2.`District Name` LIKE 'Riverside%') > 400''')\n\nrun('q26 frpmcounty','''SELECT f.`School Name`,s.Street,s.City,s.State,s.Zip FROM frpm f JOIN schools s ON f.CDSCode=s.CDSCode WHERE f.`County Name`='Monterey' AND f.`FRPM Count (Ages 5-17)`>800 AND f.`School Type`='High Schools (Public)' ''')\nrun('q26 schoolcounty','''SELECT f.`School Name`,s.Street,s.City,s.State,s.Zip FROM frpm f JOIN schools s ON f.CDSCode=s.CDSCode WHERE s.County='Monterey' AND f.`FRPM Count (Ages 5-17)`>800 AND f.`School Type`='High Schools (Public)' ''')\n\nrun('q27','''SELECT s.School,t.AvgScrWrite,s.Phone FROM schools s LEFT JOIN satscores t ON s.CDSCode=t.cds WHERE s.OpenDate > '1991-12-31' OR s.ClosedDate < '2000-01-01' ''')\n\nrun('q31','''SELECT f.`Free Meal Count (K-12)`/f.`Enrollment (K-12)` FROM frpm f ORDER BY f.`Enrollment (K-12)` DESC LIMIT 2 OFFSET 9''')\nrun('q31 near','''SELECT f.CDSCode,f.`Enrollment (K-12)`,f.`Free Meal Count (K-12)`/f.`Enrollment (K-12)` FROM frpm f ORDER BY f.`Enrollment (K-12)` DESC LIMIT 14''')\n\nrun('q5','''SELECT COUNT(*) FROM satscores t JOIN schools s ON t.cds=s.CDSCode WHERE t.AvgScrMath>400 AND s.Virtual='F' ''')\nrun('q11','''SELECT CDSCode FROM frpm WHERE `Enrollment (K-12)`+`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)`>500''')\nrun('q17','''SELECT s.CharterNum,t.AvgScrWrite,RANK() OVER (ORDER BY t.AvgScrWrite DESC) FROM satscores t JOIN schools s ON t.cds=s.CDSCode WHERE t.AvgScrWrite>499 AND s.CharterNum IS NOT NULL ORDER BY t.AvgScrWrite DESC''')\nPY", "description": "Test candidate SQL interpretations"}}
